OL,3,GNEWSAArtists sought to create village
OL,4,Alandmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtists are being encouraged to put
OL,7,Fthemselves forward for a public art
OL,8,Fproject.
OL,10,FTorridge District Council has asked for
OL,11,Fexpressions of interest from people
OL,12,Fkeen to create an original artwork for
OL,13,Fand about Westward Ho! in Devon.
OL,15,FThe council said expressions of
OL,16,Finterest deadline was 5 October, after
OL,17,Fwhich three artists would be
OL,18,Fshortlisted and receive a pitch fee for
OL,19,Fan outline concept.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
