OL,3,GNEWSAArtists sought to create village
OL,4,Alandmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Claire Hodson said the piece
OL,7,Fof art "has the potential to become a
OL,8,Fvalued landmark in the village,
OL,9,Ffostering pride among residents and
OL,10,Foffering a fresh cultural experience
OL,11,Ffor our visitors".
